---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/qccbot-cover.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About QCCBot"
	description="QCCBot is an AI-powered cloud phone platform for mobile automation, batch device management, and isolated Android workflows."
	pubDate={new Date('June 02 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
	hideMeta
>
	<p>
		QCCBot is built for teams that need to run mobile workflows across many isolated Android cloud
		phones without turning every task into manual device work.
	</p>

	<p>
		The platform combines cloud phone creation, remote control, proxy configuration, group
		management, task execution, and script logs with AI-assisted script generation and recovery.
	</p>

	<p>
		QCCBot is especially useful for social media operations teams, cross-border sellers,
		developers, and QA teams that need repeatable mobile automation with clear device separation.
	</p>
</Layout>
